{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118720","id":3550420163,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7TnxzD","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118720","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118720.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118720.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118720","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118720/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118720/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118720/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b3f7179e55359261499a00886f5b30c64ae792ac","number":118720,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Move top-level logo and icon variants to `misc/logo`","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Related to #118699.\r\n\r\nThis further tidies up the root folder of the repository, so it's now mainly:\r\n- `README.md` / `LICENSE.txt` / `COPYRIGHT.txt` / etc. i.e. typical top-level documentation.\r\n- Buildsystem entry point (`SConstruct`) and main definitions (`methods.py`, `version.py`).\r\n- Git and contribution tooling dotfiles (`.git*`, `.clang*`, `.pre-commit-config.yaml`, etc.). `pyproject.toml` is the odd one out that's not a dotfile, but there doesn't seem to be a dotfile equivalent sadly.\r\n- `bin`, `doc`, `misc`, and the rest are code folders.\r\n\r\nTogether with #118699, it yields:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1171\" height=\"58\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/38feda99-c5a7-4241-8c7a-51a830076e87\" />\r\n\r\nOn GitHub's repo view where dotfiles aren't hidden:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"973\" height=\"867\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1dc6835a-ba08-463f-b7b5-2f7b6e2da0be\" />\r\n\r\nStill pretty cluttered but not as bad as:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"957\" height=\"914\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/43e07537-e537-463b-bb02-f15aeb9a1763\" />\r\n<img width=\"956\" height=\"510\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f3ee8bd6-393c-4248-9202-265f5eeb0d4d\" />\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Note\r\n\r\nI had thought of doing this multiple times in the past, but I always ended up considering that having `icon.svg` and `logo.svg` easy to find at the top-level was important, as folks often need them if they need to include a Godot logo somewhere. We have https://godotengine.org/press/ however which provides the same and more variants. It's not clear how much people rely on this Git repo for finding branding assets.\r\n\r\nPersonally, I often grab one of the icons from the top-level if I e.g. create a Godot project with `touch project.godot` and end up lacking a nice `icon.svg` :) But I'll find my way to `misc/logo/` for this.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godot